	(text_box "Sealed tactile switch to GND, TVS at the switch, 1 kOhm series, 10 nF to GND. Pull-up 100 kOhm to 3V3_AON is on 03\n(contract §5.1); release time constant 101 k x 10 nF = 1 ms. The 1 k / 10 nF also slows ESD edges into the wake logic,\nwhich enables both controller regulators directly (§B1.7, D-26)."
